ss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230821000255"},{"id":"D37","kind":"DART 공시","title":"증권발행결과(자율공시)(제3자배정 유상증자)","date":"2023-05-10","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230510900334"},{"id":"D38","kind":"DART 공시","title":"전환사채(해외전환사채포함)발행후만기전사채취득(제23회차)","date":"2023-05-08","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230508900307"},{"id":"D39","kind":"DART 공시","title":"전환가액의조정(제24회차)","date":"2023-02-15","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230215900717"},{"id":"D40","kind":"DART 공시","title":"전환사채(해외전환사채포함)발행후만기전사채취득(제23회차)","date":"2023-02-07","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230207900519"},{"id":"R","kind":"DART 사업보고서","title":"사업보고서 (2024.12) 'II. 사업의 내용'","date":"2025-03-19","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20250319000912"}]}